1
00:00:02,736 --> 00:00:04,436
(Penny:)So, tell me about your day--
how's it going

2
00:00:04,438 --> 00:00:05,768
(Penny:)with the particle detector?

3
00:00:05,773 --> 00:00:07,703
Wow! You remember that?

4
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:09,308
(Penny:)Yeah, I listen
to what you say.

5
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:10,680
(Penny:)You're building
a particle detector

6
00:00:10,678 --> 00:00:12,848
(Penny:)using superfluid helium.

7
00:00:12,847 --> 00:00:14,847
(Leonard:)You know, when you
talk like that,

8
00:00:14,849 --> 00:00:17,149
(Leonard:)I want to take you
right here on this table.

9
00:00:17,151 --> 00:00:19,151
(Penny:)And you know
from past experience

10
00:00:19,153 --> 00:00:20,853
(Penny:)this table cannot support
both our weight.

11
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:24,660
(Penny:)So, how's
the detector going?

12
00:00:24,658 --> 00:00:26,788
(Leonard:)Well, it's tricky working
with superfluids.

13
00:00:26,794 --> 00:00:28,064
(Leonard:)Whatever container
you put them in,

14
00:00:28,062 --> 00:00:29,632
(Leonard:)they kind of
creep up the sides

15
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:30,900
(Leonard:)and crawl out
all on their own.

16
00:00:30,898 --> 00:00:33,528
(Penny:)Kind of like
Sheldon's ant farm.

17
00:00:33,534 --> 00:00:36,134
(Leonard:)Exactly, except you don't have
a lunatic running around,

18
00:00:36,137 --> 00:00:39,367
yelling, "I fed you sugar water,
why are you biting me?!"

19
00:00:41,175 --> 00:00:43,075
(Leonard:)Come on, this is boring-- you
really want to talk about this?

20
00:00:43,077 --> 00:00:44,077
(Penny:)No, I do.

21
00:00:44,078 --> 00:00:45,508
I-I didn't write
"superfluid helium"

22
00:00:45,513 --> 00:00:47,113
(Penny:)on this napkin for nothing.

23
00:00:48,082 --> 00:00:49,482
(Leonard:)Okay, well...

24
00:00:49,483 --> 00:00:50,913
(Leonard:)This is cool.

25
00:00:50,918 --> 00:00:53,088
(Leonard:)Uh, there's a thing called
"superfluid vacuum theory,"

26
00:00:53,087 --> 00:00:55,187
(Leonard:)where empty space is
imagined as a superfluid

27
00:00:55,189 --> 00:00:56,889
(Leonard:)with all of
its qualities--

28
00:00:56,891 --> 00:01:01,021
(Leonard:)viscosity, density,
surface tension...

